config REALTEK_DISPLAY_ENABLE_JPU
    bool "Enable JPU (CodaJ12 JPEG codec)"
    default n
    help
        Driver for the CodaJ12 JPEG codec IP.

        The OS is not selected here: inc/rtl_jpu_port.h branches on JPU_OS_*,
        which SConscript and CMake each state for their own target.

        This is the driver's only build-time option.
